# Local-dev override for the embedded local-mode Compose template, written by
# volcano-web's `make dev` from the selected volcano-hosting checkout. The
# committed docker-compose.template.yml remains the default; this override just
# lets local builds pick up unreleased hosting changes. Never committed.
